observed = "The gateway Ingress (platform/hosted/gateway/deployment.yaml lines 187-189) serves gateway.testnet.layerx.network, while every client-facing source names api.testnet.layerx.network: .github/workflows/platform.yml LAYERX_GATEWAY_URL (lines 334 and 348), platform/hosted/testnet/src/lib.rs gateway_endpoint (line 69), platform/docs/testnet.md (line 3), platform/docs/content/guide/interop.md (line 40) and every platform/examples/*/layerx.example.json. No manifest binds faucet.testnet.layerx.network either: platform/hosted/testnet/deployment.yaml exposes the faucet as the LoadBalancer Service layerx-faucet-public (line 170-176) without an Ingress host. The beta contract lists both as the contradictions gateway_hostname and faucet_hostname and beta-contract-check requires them to stay listed until the sources agree."
assumption = "Task 3.6 (req 7.6) makes testnet-control, the gateway manifest, the workflow and the docs agree on one gateway hostname, and task 3.7 binds the faucet hostname during beta cluster bring-up; the contract rows are then removed. Task 1.1 did not edit either source because both are outside its touches and the choice of hostname is the owner's."
severity = "suspect"

