observed = "cg spec done 3.5 ran verify_cmd (make interop-test-ramps) to pass (9 passed, 0 failed) and every touch check to pass, then failed its graph symbol check for Journal::append and ProviderCallbackApplied. Both are defined at platform/ramps/toolkit/src/journal.rs (impl method append on Journal at line 949, enum variant Event::ProviderCallbackApplied at line 82); the Codify graph does not resolve path-qualified impl methods or enum variants, so cg symbol reports them not defined."
assumption = "The task was marked done with --force solely to override the two graph symbol checks that cannot see impl-qualified methods and enum variants; the verify_cmd was executed and passed and no gate was skipped, consistent with observation.1.1.7."
